{
  "##": [
    "Generated by scripts/sync-channels.ts — do not edit by hand. Lives in the public bucket repository siri1410/scoop-sdods as bucket/sdods.json, which makes the install `scoop bucket add sdods https://github.com/siri1410/scoop-sdods; scoop install sdods`.",
    "Scoop's schema sets additionalProperties:false and '##' is the only comment key it allows, so every note lives in this one array — a '##installer' key fails validation.",
    "electron-builder's NSIS takes /S for silent and /D for the target directory. /D must come last and must not be quoted — that is an NSIS rule, not a Scoop one, and quoting it silently installs to the default location instead."
  ],
  "version": "0.1.1",
